5.4 Personal details (name, ID, phone)
The user is told they can fold or crop. The app also offers auto-masking: after OCR, any text in the header region matching name, ID, phone, email or date-of-birth patterns is not copied into report_values, not sent to any LLM and not written to the summary. Only test values, units, ranges, report date, lab name and test names are kept.
The original file is stored as uploaded (the user chose what it shows). It is never given to an LLM. Only structured, de-identified text is.
5.5 Summary content (exact values, exact dates)
The summary must keep every value as written. No rounding, no unit conversion unless a verified conversion exists, and then both original and converted values are stored.

