E10-S1 Setup choice. AC: S-A, S-B or “neither”; setup profile saved; “neither” disables capture and shows the three buttons of 6.10.
E10-S2 Guided preparation. AC: all steps of 6.3 shown in order; abstinence days and collection time recorded; timer warns after 1 hour.
E10-S3 Calibration. AC: ruler image gives µm per pixel with 3% consistency; failure message; setup profile stores value and date.
